<title>JAPAN: Sun Messe - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sun Messe - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.50		vs	    5.83</p>
<p> Operating	  617    million    vs	  458    million</p>
<p> Current	    646    million    vs	  360    million</p>
<p> Net		  296    million    vs	  190    million</p>
<p> EPS		   33.22 yen	  vs	   25.24 yen</p>
<p> Shares		9 million	  vs	   8 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.50 yen	  vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Sun Messe Co Ltd is involved in commercial printing.</p>
</text>
